  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, combine chopped kale, azifa, berbere spice, cumin, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Drizzle olive oil over the mixture and toss to coat.",
    "4. Add water to the bowl and mix well.",
    "5. Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and cover with aluminum foil.",
    "6. Bake for 30 minutes.",
    "7. Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 15-20 minutes.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
